al  villain syndicates international  criminals and international heroes and  with international heroes like stars and  stripes now entering the story this  might be the perfect time to finally  introduce hisashimi doria as an  undercover international hero who  finally returns to japan in its time of  need this scenario is one of the few  possible scenarios that could  realistically explain why he says she  has been missing for so long without his  absence being nothing more than a meme  so that is why i personally like this  theory okay it is finally time to talk  about the craziest mind-breaking theory  about the tragic fate of deku's father  hisashi midoriya in that mha video that  i talked about previously i discussed  the theory that shigaraki was actually  born quirkless and that his quirk decay  was secretly transferred to him by all  for one when he was five years old a  second component of that theory states  that the original owner of the k was  actually deku but his quirk was stolen  from him by ujjiko and all for one when  he was still a newborn baby and then  later this same quirk was given to  shigaraki the theory itself was fun and  everything but then i saw a comment that  contained the craziest theory about  deku's dad that i had ever seen a  commenter named gomibako said that if  deku really was born with decay maybe  while he was still a baby he  accidentally activated the quirk and  killed his own father kind of like eddie  accidentally killed her dad with her  quirk rewind deku's mother then made a  deal with dr ujiko to take this  dangerous quirk away from her son before  he accidentally hurts more people and  she covered the whole thing up in order  to protect deku from the heart breaking  truth the fact that he accidentally  killed his own father when he was just a  baby everything we know about hisashi  including his working abroad and his  fire-breathing quirk could just be part  of inco's cover-up in this scenario  inco would have to have been in on the  cover-up with ujico which is why when  she and little deku met up with ujica a  few years later to talk about deku's  lack of a quirk inco looked almost  guilty and ashamed while talking to the  doctor  this theory is interesting because  normally i would never think that inco  would be capable of such deception but  the one possible exception would be if  she felt that she was protecting deku  from a really dark and tragic truth if  she felt that the truth would hurt her  son and probably scar him for life she  may be willing to outright lie to him  for decades for his own good now i don't  think that this theory is very likely  but i do appreciate how dark and insane  it actually is and if it did turn out to  be true it would absolutely blow the  mind of every fan alright guys now it's  time for you to give me your theories  and opinions about deku's dad hisashi is  he just a normal guy is he a villain is  he an undercover agent have we already  met him at some point in the story or is  he actually dead let me know down below  i always love hearing from you as always  if you enjoyed this video and you want  to see more videos like this in the  future don't forget to leave that like  it actually helps a lot and if you're  new to animal pro or you watch our  videos but you just haven't taken the  time to subscribe yet it would actually  help me out a lot if you subscribed hit  that bell and select the option that  says all you can also hit me up on  twitter and instagram at animeopror and  of course a big thank you to all of our  anime uproar patrons who make videos  like this one possible special thank you  to alpha sigma this guy is an absolute  mad lad and a disciple of lord twigo  himself and i can't forget all of our  the one tier patrons the ones that rise  above all other clans including ingrata  algital pate heffa hinokami in water the  toasted chi corey mcgowan the spike  eight two two seven kaido might be a  gyarados dylan isidor spidey life canal  tungsten tarkis big buddhist cody hebert  and jeremy cummings finally thank you  also to our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only gilgamesh the  red-haired ravens steelers on hell crews  very gucci alicia octor bonnie parks  joanne garcia fat boy games and jessica  rabbit if you enjoy our videos and you  feel that they provide value to you  consider supporting us on patreon even a  single dollar will give you access to  our patron exclusive discord and your  name will appear in our videos along  with these legendary people as always  thank you guys so much for watching and  until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

